    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12384548/comment/12551217",
          "id": "12551217",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Attached a patch that makes all exceptions that extend BaseException extend Exception instead. Since BaseException is nowhere caught and there is little in common with the descendant exceptions, there's no benefit in making them all extend BaseException.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2007-12-13T05:00:39.706+0000",
          "updated": "2007-12-13T05:00:39.706+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12384548/comment/12551257",
          "id": "12551257",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=stefan%40jira",
            "name": "stefan@jira",
            "key": "stefan@jira",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Stefan Guggisberg",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "body": "i don't agree. what's the benefit of removing BaseException?\n\nfor a related discussion see http://www.mail-archive.com/jackrabbit-dev@incubator.apache.org/msg04384.html\n\n-1 for removing BaseException unless there's a substantial benefit in doing so.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=stefan%40jira",
            "name": "stefan@jira",
            "key": "stefan@jira",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Stefan Guggisberg",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Berlin"
          },
          "created": "2007-12-13T08:36:20.892+0000",
          "updated": "2007-12-13T08:36:20.892+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12384548/comment/12551261",
          "id": "12551261",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Stefan:\n> i don't agree. what's the benefit of removing BaseException?\n\nOn the other hand, what's the benefit of having BaseException? A while ago (the jackrabbit-dev@i.a.o reference) there still were a few catch clauses for BaseException, but now there are *no* places where BaseException is caught.\n\nIf it's not used, I'd rather just get rid of it.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jukkaz",
            "name": "jukkaz",
            "key": "jukkaz",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=jukkaz&avatarId=15130"
            },
            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2007-12-13T08:56:15.180+0000",
          "updated": "2007-12-13T08:56:15.180+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12384548/comment/12587643",
          "id": "12587643",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=angela",
            "name": "angela",
            "key": "anchela",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Angela Schreiber",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "this issue does not affect jcr2spi any more.\nthe only usages of BaseException in jcr2spi got removed with revision 641299. ",
